#: ../../Operation/Troubleshooting.rst:1
msgid ""
"Reduce the pH of the water slightly (perhaps 0.5 pH units) to eliminate the "
"supersaturation"
msgstr ""
"Reduce ligeramente el pH del agua (quizá 0,5 unidades de pH) para eliminar "
