#: ../../Operation/Troubleshooting.rst:1
msgid ""
"Dissolution of carbon dioxide from the atmosphere causes precipitation of "
"calcium carbonate"
msgstr ""
"La disolución del dióxido de carbono de la atmósfera provoca precipitación "
